sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as ImageRegeneration.razor
  participant S as ImageSessionService
  participant H as CorrelationHeaderHandler
  participant M as Middleware
  participant E as /api/images/analyze
  participant O as ImageAnalysisOrchestrator
  participant AI as Vision → OpenAI → Imagen
  participant SV as UserImageSaveService
  participant R as AzureBlobUserImageRepository
  participant ST as Azure Storage (Azurite in dev)

  U->>P: choose file (≤ 20 MB client cap)
  P->>S: hold active image for the browser session
  U->>P: Regenerate
  P->>H: PostAsJsonAsync("api/images/analyze", ImageAnalysisRequest)
  H->>M: + X-Session-ID / X-Correlation-ID, auth cookie

  M->>M: Kestrel body cap 25 MB
  M->>M: rate limit 10/min · authn · authz
  M->>E: ValidationFilter of ImageAnalysisRequest
  E->>O: AnalyzeAsync(Mode = ImageRegeneration)
  O->>AI: analyze → enhance → generate
  AI-->>O: description, tags, prompt, image bytes
  O-->>E: ImageAnalysisResponse (+ ProcessingMetrics)
  E-->>P: 200 OK

  P->>P: ImageRegenerationResultsPanel renders result
  U->>P: Save to gallery
  P->>SV: save result
  SV->>M: POST /api/user-images/result + Idempotency-Key
  M->>M: IdempotencyKeyFilter — 24 h IMemoryCache replay guard
  M->>R: UserImageService.SaveResultAsync(userId, bytes)
  R->>ST: Blob PUT user-images/{userId}/{imageId}
  R->>ST: Table UPSERT UserImages<br/>PartitionKey = userId, RowKey = imageId
  ST-->>R: ok
  R-->>SV: UserImageDto
  SV-->>U: Radzen toast — saved (retry offered on failure)
